OL,3,CNHS probe claims staff accessed
OL,4,Crecords of girl allegedly murdered by
OL,5,Cdad
OL,7,FAn NHS health board is investigating
OL,8,Fclaims that staff allegedly
OL,9,Finappropriately accessed the medical
OL,10,Frecords of a schoolgirl whose dad has
OL,11,Fbeen charged with her murder.
OL,13,FNine-year-old Minnie Merriman, from
OL,14,FWest Yorkshire, was found seriously
OL,15,Finjured on the Elliot industrial
OL,16,Festate in Arbroath, 17 miles north of
OL,17,FDundee, shortly after midnight on
OL,18,FMonday morning.
OL,20,FShe was taken to Ninewells Hospital
OL,21,Fwhere she died.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
