PN,33702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786385905
OL,3,CNHS probe claims staff accessed
OL,4,Crecords of girl allegedly murdered by
OL,5,Cdad
OL,7,FHer father, Christopher Rice, has
OL,8,Fsince been charged with murder.
OL,10,FHe was committed for further
OL,11,Fexamination and remanded in custody
OL,12,Funtil his next court appearance.
OL,14,FThe hospital, managed by NHS Tayside,
OL,15,Fis now investigating claims staff
OL,16,Faccessed Minnie's medical records
OL,17,Fwithout clinical need or permission.
OL,19,FThe alleged data breach could be
OL,20,Freported and escalated to the
OL,21,FInformation Commissioner's Office (ICO)
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
