PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786385905
OL,3,CNHS probe claims staff accessed
OL,4,Crecords of girl allegedly murdered by
OL,5,Cdad
OL,7,FA spokesperson for the health board
OL,8,Fsaid: "NHS Tayside is currently
OL,9,Finvestigating the circumstances of an
OL,10,Falleged data breach, which happened in
OL,11,Fa working clinical area where staff
OL,12,Faccess patient information.
OL,14,F"As a matter of governance, any data
OL,15,Fprotection breach would be recorded
OL,16,Fand investigated by NHS Tayside and,
OL,17,Fwhere appropriate, reported to the
OL,18,FInformation Commissioner's Office.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,338,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786385905
OL,3,CNHS probe claims staff accessed
OL,4,Crecords of girl allegedly murdered by
OL,5,Cdad
OL,7,F"It would not be appropriate for us to
OL,8,Fcomment further on individual staffing
OL,9,Fmatters."
OL,11,FOn Thursday, Minnie's school paid
OL,12,Ftribute to the 'kind and caring'
OL,13,Fschoolgirl.
OL,15,FKelly Ashton, Headteacher at Hendal
OL,16,FPrimary School in Kettlethorpe, said:
OL,17,F"We are heartbroken by the death of
OL,18,FMinnie.
OL,20,F"Minnie was a kind and thoughtful girl
OL,21,Fwho was loved by all of her friends.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
