CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F337A1786385905
OL,3,CNHS probe claims staff accessed
OL,4,Crecords of girl allegedly murdered by
OL,5,Cdad
OL,7,FShe added: "She has belonged to our
OL,8,Fschool community for four years and
OL,9,Fwill be remembered as a caring and
OL,10,Fcreative girl who was always seen with
OL,11,Fa big smile on her face. She will be
OL,12,Fdeeply missed by us all."
OL,14,FIt is believed Minnie had been camping
OL,15,Fin the area with family members when
OL,16,Fshe was found injured, with Police
OL,17,FScotland saying they were not looking
OL,18,Ffor anyone else in connection.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
