OL,3,CNHS probe claims staff accessed
OL,4,Crecords of girl allegedly murdered by
OL,5,Cdad
OL,7,FMinnie's family had earlier paid
OL,8,Ftribute to her in a statement released
OL,9,Fthrough Police Scotland.
OL,11,FThey said: "We are devastated with the
OL,12,Floss of our beloved, absolutely
OL,13,Fincredible, beautiful and brave Minnie
OL,14,FMoo.
OL,16,F"Our family asks that our privacy is
OL,17,Frespected at this extremely difficult
OL,18,Ftime."
